an=\"142\"><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> get<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> v <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> get<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> v <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> get<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> v <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Types</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> get<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> v <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Index-based value accessor: If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">v.<span class=\"me1\">index</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> I</span></code>, returns a reference to the value stored in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">v</span></code>. Otherwise, throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/bad_variant_access\">std::bad_variant_access</a></span>. The call is ill-formed if <code>I</code> is not a valid index in the variant.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Type-based value accessor: If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">v</span></code> holds the alternative <code>T</code>, returns a reference to the value stored in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">v</span></code>. Otherwise, throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/bad_variant_access\">std::bad_variant_access</a></span>. The call is ill-formed if <code>T</code> is not a unique element of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Types...</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> I\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> index to look up\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> T\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> unique type to look up\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> Types...\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> types forming the <code>variant</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> v\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>variant</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reference to the value stored in the variant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> Throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/bad_variant_access\">std::bad_variant_access</a></span> on errors.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;variant&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">float</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">12</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, w<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    w <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    w <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// same effect as the previous line</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co1\">//  std::get&lt;double&gt;(v); // error: no double in [int, float]</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  std::get&lt;3&gt;(v);      // error: valid index values are 0 and 1</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">try</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        w <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu17\">42.0f</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">float</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>w<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// ok, prints 42</span>\n        w <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">float</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>w<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// throws</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">catch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/bad_variant_access\"><span class=\"kw1097\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bad_variant_access</span></span></a> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ex<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ex.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\": w contained int, not float<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>12\n42\nUnexpected index: w contained int, not float</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/g